== Notes ==
*This spell does not have a somatic [[component]], so arcane [[spell failure]] from the caster's [[armor]] and [[shield]] is ignored when this spell is cast.
* The "sonic" descriptor mentioned in-game is not used by this spell.
*When targeted onto a usable, non-[[plot]] object directly, this spell destroys the object as if the fortitude save was failed.
*Due to a .2da bug, ''wail of the banshee'' is not an additional [[counterspell]] of ''silence''.

